WEBVTT

00:04:28.636 --> 00:04:30.236
of the Alpha Coal mine.

00:04:30.556 --> 00:04:31.796
We succeeded,

00:04:31.836 --> 00:04:33.956
moved on to our third objective,

00:04:33.996 --> 00:04:38.316
to get French banks to commit
not to finance any new coal mines,

00:04:38.316 --> 00:04:41.276
any new coal plants worldwide.

00:04:41.316 --> 00:04:44.956
We did one bank, two banks,
three banks, four banks,

00:04:44.996 --> 00:04:47.756
until we convinced all French banks,

00:04:47.796 --> 00:04:51.596
the fourth-biggest
banking sector worldwide,

00:04:51.636 --> 00:04:55.396
to reject all project financing
for the coal sector.

00:04:55.396 --> 00:05:02.396
(Applause)